OL,3,A'I tell my son it's just fireworks':
OL,4,ALife inside Yemeni city besieged by
OL,5,AHouthis
OL,6,
OL,7,FTaiz has long been a prize - and a
OL,8,Ffront line - in Yemen's civil war.
OL,10,FHouthi forces tightened their grip last
OL,11,Fmonth, fully encircling the
OL,12,Fgovernment-controlled city, and the
OL,13,Fpopulation - estimated to be between
OL,14,F600,000 and 1 million.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
